WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:03.030
Every week, in gurdwaras around the world,

2
00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:06.480
Sikhs sit together on the
floor before their scripture.

3
00:00:06.530 --> 00:00:10.700
Men and women, every
caste, Sikhs and visitors:

4
00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:12.330
anyone may join.

5
00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:16.720
Sikhs call a gathering like
this a sangat: a congregation.

6
00:00:16.770 --> 00:00:22.380
Today the Sikh community is worldwide,
and some Sikhs live far from any sangat.

7
00:00:22.430 --> 00:00:25.060
So can you follow a religion on your own?

8
00:00:25.110 --> 00:00:27.180
Or do you need other people?

9
00:00:27.230 --> 00:00:31.600
In this mission, you'll find out
what makes a gathering a true sangat.

10
00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:36.120
Then you'll see how Sikhs try to keep
their faith when they live far from one.

11
00:00:36.170 --> 00:00:39.610
Your mission: find out what
the sangat gives a Sikh,

12
00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:41.170
and what happens without one.
